WEBVTT

00:15.265 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

02:48.251 --> 02:50.253
My lord! I'm stuck!

03:04.809 --> 03:05.935
My lord!

03:37.842 --> 03:39.344
Hurry up!

03:39.427 --> 03:41.429
Shit! Hurry up!

03:42.639 --> 03:43.806
What are you doing?

03:43.890 --> 03:46.017
Open it already!

03:47.435 --> 03:48.269
Hurry!

03:48.853 --> 03:51.064
Hurry up! Shit!

03:54.734 --> 03:57.862
Hurry! Come on!

04:12.585 --> 04:15.171
The key! Where's the key?

04:16.839 --> 04:17.799
There's no door!

04:17.882 --> 04:20.301
The key! Bring me the key!

04:20.385 --> 04:23.388
Open it! Now!

04:27.809 --> 04:28.643
Open it!

04:29.644 --> 04:31.813
Lock it! Now!

04:31.896 --> 04:33.940
Hurry up! Lock it!

05:03.886 --> 05:05.513
No! Don't go there!

05:40.757 --> 05:42.592
Please, help. Help!

05:47.138 --> 05:49.390
No! Stop!

05:49.474 --> 05:51.309
No! Don't come any closer!

06:16.376 --> 06:18.503
Come here. Come.

06:30.848 --> 06:31.766
Here.

06:33.309 --> 06:35.436
Help!

06:36.354 --> 06:37.522
- Open the door!
- Help!

06:37.605 --> 06:39.023
- Someone is out there.
- Help me!

06:39.399 --> 06:40.942
- This way! Here!
- Come this way!

06:41.567 --> 06:42.777
- Run!
- Hurry!

06:43.319 --> 06:44.904
The door is locked!

06:46.197 --> 06:47.323
This way!

07:03.840 --> 07:05.508
Let go of her!

07:06.592 --> 07:07.885
Oh, no!

07:09.554 --> 07:12.056
- She got bitten!
- Let go! Let go of her hand!

07:12.348 --> 07:15.309
What are you doing?
She was already bitten!

07:16.310 --> 07:19.355
Grab the baby. Hurry!

07:20.481 --> 07:21.691
Let go of her!

07:23.526 --> 07:25.528
Let go! She was bitten!

07:30.116 --> 07:31.284
Let go of her!

07:32.160 --> 07:33.911
Please, help me!

08:40.895 --> 08:43.189
These peasants are attacking noblemen!

08:49.111 --> 08:50.530
Shut the gate! Shut it now!

08:57.328 --> 08:58.162
Shit!

09:12.051 --> 09:14.845
These look great.

09:15.513 --> 09:17.723
- It is so heavy.
- Hurry!

09:17.848 --> 09:19.100
What is going on?

09:19.350 --> 09:20.476
Run!

09:25.314 --> 09:27.066
Hey! Park!

09:28.234 --> 09:30.236
We caught fish! Come here!

09:30.319 --> 09:31.988
Is that him?

09:32.071 --> 09:34.198
It is obviously him.

09:34.282 --> 09:35.616
My gosh.

09:36.158 --> 09:37.952
He must have drunk a lot today.

09:38.828 --> 09:40.580
Hey! Are you drunk?

09:41.455 --> 09:44.208
- Who are those people?
- My gosh.

09:44.292 --> 09:45.418
Hey.

09:47.003 --> 09:47.837
What is going on?

09:48.337 --> 09:49.839
- Hey.
- What is wrong with them?

09:49.922 --> 09:52.341
Hey! What is that?

09:59.599 --> 10:02.727
Stop running. You will get hungry.

10:03.436 --> 10:05.313
Stop fighting. Don't bite him!

10:05.396 --> 10:06.981
That will scar!

10:07.064 --> 10:08.899
- Let go!
- You punk.

10:08.983 --> 10:10.651
- I said, that will scar.
- Let go!

10:13.070 --> 10:14.030
Get off me!

10:33.883 --> 10:35.468
Father.

10:38.512 --> 10:39.764
What is wrong?

11:03.496 --> 11:06.916
Deok-i, stay here.
I will go look for your sister.

11:08.584 --> 11:09.919
Do not come out.

11:45.204 --> 11:46.205
Mommy!

11:48.290 --> 11:49.750
What is wrong with you?

11:51.585 --> 11:52.920
You are scaring me!

11:53.754 --> 11:55.256
Stop it, Mommy!

11:55.339 --> 11:56.465
Stop it!

13:29.266 --> 13:30.184
Your Royal Highness!

13:42.112 --> 13:43.239
Your Royal Highness!

13:56.919 --> 13:58.546
Your Royal Highness, run!

14:04.552 --> 14:05.469
Hold on tight!

14:40.880 --> 14:43.632
You must aim for their heads.

14:43.716 --> 14:46.176
Your Royal Highness! The barracks.

14:47.094 --> 14:48.387
You must go to the barracks.

14:58.564 --> 15:00.608
We must hurry, Your Royal Highness.

15:01.817 --> 15:02.735
Your Royal Highness!

15:11.243 --> 15:13.329
Is anyone inside?

15:14.079 --> 15:15.623
Please let us in!

15:19.001 --> 15:20.002
Is anyone inside?

15:20.544 --> 15:21.503
Is anyone there?

15:24.006 --> 15:26.592
- Monsters are chasing us!
- I don't think anyone is here.

15:31.305 --> 15:32.181
Your Highness.

15:34.808 --> 15:35.643
Please climb up.

15:37.227 --> 15:40.689
Excuse us. I'm sorry,
but please step aside!

15:40.814 --> 15:41.649
Step aside!

15:47.988 --> 15:50.282
- We should climb the wall.
- Let us climb the wall!

16:03.754 --> 16:05.839
Get off the fence at once!

16:07.591 --> 16:08.926
Someone is inside!

16:09.969 --> 16:10.803
Get rid of them.

16:11.303 --> 16:12.471
Shoo them away. Now!

16:15.975 --> 16:17.768
- Don't shoot!
- Get rid of them.

16:20.187 --> 16:21.105
Your Royal Highness!

16:21.855 --> 16:23.065
Are you all right?

16:24.108 --> 16:25.067
How dare you?

16:25.150 --> 16:27.236
He is the Crown Prince of this nation!

16:27.319 --> 16:28.153
Open the gate!

16:29.196 --> 16:30.489
Please, let us in.

16:30.572 --> 16:32.116
Don't try to fool me!

16:32.700 --> 16:35.369
Don't give me your nonsense, and scram!
All of you!

16:35.452 --> 16:40.541
Anyone who climbs over this wall
shall be dealt with by law!

16:40.624 --> 16:43.460
- Let us climb up! Come on!
- Let us climb up, too!

16:43.544 --> 16:45.921
How dare you?
What do you think you're doing?

16:51.927 --> 16:53.137
Why, those...

16:53.220 --> 16:55.514
Get down! Down!

16:55.597 --> 16:58.434
- Let the children in!
- Didn't you hear me? Push them off!

17:01.520 --> 17:02.730
- Go down!
- Scram!

17:02.813 --> 17:04.565
- Get away!
- Go down!

17:04.648 --> 17:06.525
- Go down!
- I said, scram!

17:06.608 --> 17:08.235
Get down!

17:08.318 --> 17:09.528
Don't come up here!

17:10.029 --> 17:11.989
Shoot! Shoot the arrows!

17:16.326 --> 17:17.828
How dare you?

17:17.911 --> 17:19.747
If you get any closer,

17:20.539 --> 17:23.625
these arrows will pierce your bodies!

17:23.709 --> 17:26.295
Please help us!
Please don't leave us here to die!

17:36.889 --> 17:38.432
What the...

17:42.227 --> 17:44.104
Your Royal Highness, you must go.

17:44.438 --> 17:47.274
Run! Everyone, run!

17:47.858 --> 17:48.817
Run!

19:29.209 --> 19:30.127
Your Royal Highness.

19:33.046 --> 19:35.591
That female physician spoke the truth.

19:35.966 --> 19:37.301
How could this happen?

20:04.953 --> 20:08.582
The baby inside you
will be the king of this nation,

20:09.208 --> 20:10.876
so be careful.

20:12.169 --> 20:16.548
You must teach him
what happens to a powerless king.

20:20.636 --> 20:22.930
Until the new Crown Prince is born,

20:24.389 --> 20:28.769
you must make sure His Majesty
has plenty to eat and drink.

21:30.414 --> 21:31.540
Mommy.

21:58.650 --> 22:01.695
Stop! Just stop already!

22:04.197 --> 22:05.407
Shit! I'm exhausted.

23:41.128 --> 23:42.212
My clothes got dirty.

23:42.379 --> 23:44.131
I shall prepare fresh clothes.

23:58.812 --> 24:00.313
Go for a walk.

25:22.521 --> 25:24.439
Come down.

26:18.285 --> 26:20.078
My lord!

26:21.371 --> 26:23.123
My gosh!

26:23.206 --> 26:24.291
Why you...

26:24.374 --> 26:25.333
Oh, my. My lord.

26:27.252 --> 26:28.128
My lord.

26:29.004 --> 26:31.131
Thank goodness you are safe.

26:31.214 --> 26:32.924
Where were you until now?

26:33.883 --> 26:35.135
I was...

26:35.218 --> 26:36.886
I wanted to save you,

26:37.304 --> 26:41.016
so I brought all those soldiers.

26:41.099 --> 26:42.726
Save me? Now?

26:42.892 --> 26:44.436
Do you know what I went through?

26:44.519 --> 26:46.980
I would have died last night
if not for her!

26:49.983 --> 26:50.817
Well...

26:52.611 --> 26:56.072
That jerk! It was all that jerk's fault!

26:56.156 --> 26:57.532
- What?
- What are you doing?

26:57.616 --> 26:58.491
Capture him now!

26:58.575 --> 26:59.534
Yes, my lord.

27:04.664 --> 27:07.417
It was all his fault.

27:07.500 --> 27:11.838
He... knew all about those hideous things,

27:12.631 --> 27:14.049
but he hid it from us.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.842
I told you, didn't I?

27:16.718 --> 27:18.094
That they were not dead.

27:18.178 --> 27:20.764
How dare you glare at me like that?
I shall...

27:20.847 --> 27:22.766
He is correct! Tell us now!

27:23.058 --> 27:26.019
What are those monsters?
Where did they come from?

27:26.645 --> 27:27.479
I...

27:28.188 --> 27:29.648
I will tell you.

27:29.731 --> 27:33.360
They were the ill at Jiyulheon
and their families.

27:33.443 --> 27:35.654
They could not withstand
starvation any longer

27:36.154 --> 27:37.530
and ate a corpse, then...

27:37.614 --> 27:39.157
- What?
- They became monsters

27:39.240 --> 27:41.910
that crave human flesh and blood at night.

27:42.035 --> 27:44.496
During the day, they hide
where the sun doesn't reach

27:45.080 --> 27:47.165
and sleep as if they were dead.

27:47.248 --> 27:50.919
Human corpse... What...

27:51.002 --> 27:52.420
How could they do that?

27:53.088 --> 27:54.047
If that is true,

27:55.048 --> 27:57.342
why did you leave those corpses like that?

27:57.425 --> 27:59.010
You should have buried them

27:59.094 --> 28:01.429
when they were asleep
or gotten rid of them somehow!

28:02.889 --> 28:05.433
My lord, you must punish them
for their crimes.

28:05.517 --> 28:07.268
I'm fine with being punished,

28:07.936 --> 28:09.938
but isn't it urgent
to get rid of the bodies?

28:10.772 --> 28:13.149
When the sun sets,
more monsters will come.

28:13.233 --> 28:14.693
Then bury them quickly!

28:14.776 --> 28:15.652
Even so,

28:15.735 --> 28:17.070
- Yes--
- ...they'll climb out.

28:17.153 --> 28:19.030
You must cut off their heads
or burn them.

28:21.658 --> 28:23.410
- Burn the bodies?
- What?

28:23.993 --> 28:26.162
Who says you can burn the bodies?

28:29.040 --> 28:30.417
- Who...
- Well...

28:30.667 --> 28:34.003
She is the former commander's mother.

28:36.673 --> 28:38.967
Never desecrate the body
you got from your parents.

28:39.050 --> 28:42.053
My precious son is our family's only son
for three generations.

28:42.137 --> 28:44.431
If you so much as lay a finger
on his body,

28:44.597 --> 28:46.057
you will have to answer to me!

28:46.266 --> 28:47.976
If you lay a finger on the bodies

28:48.059 --> 28:50.603
of my family,
you will have to answer to me too!

28:54.315 --> 28:57.736
- Well, they are correct.
- What?

28:57.819 --> 29:01.239
With noblemen, even if they commit
grave crimes like murder,

29:01.322 --> 29:04.534
you cannot punish them
without the Royal Court's consent.

29:04.617 --> 29:05.785
You know that, right?

29:05.869 --> 29:07.912
- But...
- On top of that,

29:09.080 --> 29:11.082
if we burn all those bodies,

29:11.166 --> 29:13.543
we will face an angry backlash
from the upper class.

29:13.626 --> 29:15.295
Then what do I do?

29:15.378 --> 29:16.671
My gosh.

29:21.301 --> 29:24.471
- We should burn the peasants' bodies
- Okay.

29:25.054 --> 29:26.723
...and hold proper funerals

29:27.056 --> 29:29.058
for the bodies of the aristocrats.

29:29.142 --> 29:31.186
Then we should bury them

29:31.728 --> 29:34.481
deep into the ground. How about that?

29:34.564 --> 29:37.734
There are so many. How can we
differentiate nobles from peasants?

29:38.401 --> 29:40.445
Goodness. We can separate

29:40.820 --> 29:43.740
the bodies in silk from those in rags.

29:46.409 --> 29:48.244
- Great idea.
- Thank you.

29:48.328 --> 29:49.996
Split them into two groups!

29:50.079 --> 29:51.456
- Go on.
- Go.

29:52.624 --> 29:54.709
Someone responsible
for the people' safety

29:55.585 --> 29:56.669
is this incompetent?

29:59.839 --> 30:00.882
What are you doing?

30:04.010 --> 30:06.596
The instant you draw your sword,
you lose your head!

30:10.266 --> 30:13.019
Who are you that you dare do this?

30:13.102 --> 30:14.437
You are not only incompetent,

30:14.979 --> 30:16.397
but also endlessly vile.

30:17.357 --> 30:19.484
You locked the doors
to the barracks last night,

30:19.734 --> 30:21.528
countless innocent people died.

30:21.611 --> 30:24.656
If I had opened the gate,
the soldiers would have been in danger.

30:24.739 --> 30:26.699
Firing your arrow at me

30:26.783 --> 30:29.869
is punishable by death
and annihilation of your family.

30:29.953 --> 30:31.329
You have committed treason!

30:31.412 --> 30:34.249
By the way, who are you?

30:43.341 --> 30:47.554
The four-clawed dragon... You are...

30:48.555 --> 30:50.515
It's an honor to greet the Crown Prince!

30:55.186 --> 30:56.312
What did he just say?

30:56.396 --> 30:57.647
What are you doing?

30:57.730 --> 30:59.399
He is the Crown Prince!

31:05.905 --> 31:08.241
I should kill you right this instant,

31:09.242 --> 31:10.910
but we need help so...

31:10.994 --> 31:11.828
Spare my life.

31:11.953 --> 31:14.289
I shall punish you
after resolving the situation.

31:20.003 --> 31:21.504
How many soldiers are alive?

31:24.799 --> 31:25.967
Only 50, Your Highness.

31:26.759 --> 31:29.554
- That is correct.
- Have every soldier search for bodies.

31:30.096 --> 31:32.265
They must burn them immediately.

31:32.348 --> 31:34.017
You cannot do that.

31:34.100 --> 31:37.061
I understand how you feel,
having lost your family.

31:37.437 --> 31:39.355
But we must burn them
to avoid future harm.

31:39.439 --> 31:41.399
Light a signal fire and send messengers

31:41.482 --> 31:44.319
to spread the word and request support
so we can quarantine Dongnae.

31:44.402 --> 31:45.862
And transport survivors

31:45.945 --> 31:47.822
using boats on either quayside

31:48.698 --> 31:51.034
to safety before nightfall.

31:52.744 --> 31:54.871
Cho Beom-pal, the magistrate of Dongnae,

31:54.954 --> 31:57.123
shall heed Your Royal Highness' command!

31:57.457 --> 31:59.751
- We shall obey!
- We shall obey!

32:24.192 --> 32:25.568
The signal fire has been lit!

32:42.085 --> 32:47.382
HANYANG

32:47.507 --> 32:48.841
Where is the Chief Scholar?

32:48.925 --> 32:50.259
He is waiting inside.

32:52.971 --> 32:54.973
I came out of respect to him,

32:55.890 --> 32:58.101
but things are tense now
with talk of treason.

32:58.559 --> 33:02.313
It doesn't look good to meet
secretly like this.

33:03.398 --> 33:05.400
We have something urgent to tell you.

33:06.693 --> 33:07.610
This way, please.

33:14.450 --> 33:16.077
What do you mean?

33:16.661 --> 33:19.122
Corpses were found in the King's palace?

33:20.123 --> 33:23.334
Something strange is happening there
for sure.

33:24.627 --> 33:27.422
Lord Cho Hak-ju is hiding it from us.

33:28.548 --> 33:31.801
I know you are one of his men.

33:32.260 --> 33:35.013
However, I'm telling you
because I believe you know

33:35.096 --> 33:36.389
what is right and wrong.

33:40.476 --> 33:42.186
I can't believe it.

33:43.438 --> 33:44.522
It can't be.

33:46.315 --> 33:49.777
There is only one way
to find out the truth.

33:51.529 --> 33:52.947
Let us go to the King's palace.

33:53.531 --> 33:56.868
If we go and see His Majesty in person
and confirm that he is safe,

33:56.951 --> 33:58.536
everything will become clear.

33:59.579 --> 34:01.664
The Queen has forbidden
anyone from entering

34:02.248 --> 34:03.916
the King's palace.

34:04.000 --> 34:08.087
We serve His Majesty, not the Queen.

34:10.923 --> 34:13.843
Lord Ahn Hyeon will join us.

34:16.054 --> 34:18.598
Do you mean the Lord Ahn Hyeon?

34:20.099 --> 34:22.185
He is staying low in his hometown,

34:22.393 --> 34:24.854
mourning the loss of his mother
for three years,

34:25.271 --> 34:26.814
but if he takes action,

34:27.190 --> 34:31.986
all the scholars and subjects of the land
will follow him.

34:56.719 --> 34:58.763
I was keeping an eye on Chief Scholar,

34:58.846 --> 35:01.891
and I noticed a servant running.
I found this on him.

35:01.974 --> 35:04.393
It's a letter meant
for Lord Ahn Hyeon in Sangju.

35:07.313 --> 35:09.232
All he did was read books.

35:10.316 --> 35:11.609
If he wants to challenge me,

35:12.735 --> 35:14.904
he would need Lord Ahn Hyeon's help.

35:15.988 --> 35:17.031
What should we do?

35:19.075 --> 35:20.243
Leave them be.

35:20.326 --> 35:21.452
Are you sure?

35:21.536 --> 35:23.996
Lord Ahn Hyeon saved the nation
during the war three years ago.

35:24.580 --> 35:28.084
If he supports the Crown Prince,
the people may as well.

35:28.167 --> 35:29.335
Lord Ahn Hyeon...

35:31.170 --> 35:34.006
can never oppose me.

35:36.843 --> 35:38.136
No matter what.

35:41.097 --> 35:44.183
DONGNAE

35:45.643 --> 35:47.562
My lord, I have brought the criminal.

35:50.148 --> 35:50.982
Okay.

35:54.443 --> 35:55.278
Send her in.

36:03.703 --> 36:04.954
You wanted to see me?

36:06.706 --> 36:09.375
Yes. I called you here today because--

36:10.877 --> 36:12.378
It is all my fault.

36:12.461 --> 36:14.672
I should have reported it right away,

36:15.047 --> 36:19.177
but they were like family to me,
so I thought I could cure them.

36:19.260 --> 36:20.469
Please kill me.

36:20.553 --> 36:21.387
No...

36:23.598 --> 36:25.391
No. That is not it.

36:25.474 --> 36:29.770
Well, it's your duty as a physician
to cure people.

36:29.854 --> 36:32.565
That is not all.
You saved my life last night.

36:32.982 --> 36:34.233
You are too kind, my lord.

36:34.317 --> 36:36.652
- I merely--
- No.

36:37.862 --> 36:38.696
Well...

36:39.989 --> 36:41.157
I swear...

36:42.074 --> 36:44.702
I will repay you for what you did.

36:46.579 --> 36:47.872
Until all my hair...

36:49.999 --> 36:51.584
turns white,

36:53.461 --> 36:55.338
I will keep you by my side.

36:59.592 --> 37:01.928
Do you need a physician?

37:02.637 --> 37:04.805
Do you have an ailment, my lord?

37:06.015 --> 37:09.894
- No, that is not--
- You are flushed.

37:10.061 --> 37:12.355
Are you always like that?

37:12.813 --> 37:16.734
Or are you usually fine,
but get flushed when you're nervous?

37:16.817 --> 37:20.196
It may be
because your heart or liver is unhealthy.

37:20.821 --> 37:24.450
If you do not mind,
may I check your pulse?

37:25.034 --> 37:26.244
My pulse?

37:29.747 --> 37:31.624
Men and women must be separated,

37:32.208 --> 37:34.752
but that is not a problem between us.

37:35.419 --> 37:36.462
Sure.

37:36.629 --> 37:39.548
Take your time and check my pulse.

37:48.432 --> 37:52.311
Do you have difficulty urinating?

37:52.561 --> 37:56.023
- Did you just say--
- Your lower abdomen may be strained.

37:56.649 --> 37:59.277
You may feel pain in your penis, too.

38:01.445 --> 38:04.073
My... penis?

38:05.449 --> 38:06.492
I think...

38:08.244 --> 38:09.954
it's gonorrhea.

38:10.746 --> 38:12.248
Gonorrhea?

38:12.623 --> 38:15.167
What? My...

38:15.459 --> 38:17.169
Something's wrong with my thing?

38:17.253 --> 38:18.212
Don't worry.

38:18.296 --> 38:20.548
It isn't that serious yet.

38:20.798 --> 38:23.342
You will be fine once you take medicine.

38:24.760 --> 38:25.928
My lord.

38:26.262 --> 38:28.264
The Crown Prince's guard is here.

38:28.764 --> 38:30.599
Okay.

38:31.726 --> 38:32.560
Show him in.

38:37.148 --> 38:40.026
The Crown Prince ordered me
to bring that physician.

38:40.318 --> 38:42.820
Oh... I see.

38:43.404 --> 38:44.905
In that case...

38:45.406 --> 38:48.409
You should. Sure. Go ahead.

38:59.837 --> 39:02.381
My lord! This is the head clerk.

39:05.217 --> 39:08.054
Okay. What is it?

39:10.681 --> 39:13.768
During the last night's mayhem,
all the battleships were destroyed.

39:13.851 --> 39:17.271
And there aren't enough boats
to evacuate the people.

39:17.813 --> 39:20.441
There is one decent cargo ship,

39:21.108 --> 39:24.445
so it can set sail in about two hours.

39:24.528 --> 39:27.448
How can we evacuate all those people
with just one cargo ship?

39:27.531 --> 39:29.450
I know. That is...

39:29.533 --> 39:31.202
How is the search for bodies coming along?

39:32.578 --> 39:33.412
Hey.

39:34.288 --> 39:37.583
We made every soldier available
search for bodies,

39:38.209 --> 39:39.126
but to no avail.

39:40.419 --> 39:43.255
Then find as many as possible. Go!

39:49.428 --> 39:51.389
Nothing is going right.

39:54.558 --> 39:55.726
No!

39:56.477 --> 40:00.106
- I'm sorry, my lord.
- The Crown Prince gave us a command.

40:02.525 --> 40:04.652
Come up with a plan before sunset.

40:55.119 --> 40:55.953
Yeong-ju.

41:15.222 --> 41:16.182
Master!

41:17.766 --> 41:18.934
What's going on?

41:19.518 --> 41:20.811
It wasn't like this.

41:21.520 --> 41:22.855
In Hanyang...

41:23.689 --> 41:25.733
It wasn't like this in Hanyang.

41:25.816 --> 41:26.942
When Dan-i...

41:28.194 --> 41:29.028
When Dan-i...

41:29.987 --> 41:30.988
was bitten,

41:32.072 --> 41:35.576
he was sick for days
and died as a human being.

41:38.245 --> 41:39.079
But...

41:40.456 --> 41:41.457
when those people

41:43.083 --> 41:44.168
got bitten,

41:46.045 --> 41:47.838
they turned into the same monster.

41:48.339 --> 41:49.798
The disease has changed.

41:51.133 --> 41:52.760
It has begun to spread.

41:54.845 --> 41:57.264
What are you talking about, Master?

42:00.559 --> 42:01.435
I can fix it.

42:02.269 --> 42:03.145
I can...

42:04.688 --> 42:06.148
fix this disease.

42:07.191 --> 42:10.653
I logged everything
about the disease. Everything...

42:31.340 --> 42:34.093
TWO HOURS AFTER STICKING A NEEDLE
COATED WITH CRUSHED RESURRECTION PLANT

42:34.218 --> 42:38.097
INTO HIS MAJESTY'S FOREHEAD,
HE CAME BACK TO LIFE

42:45.604 --> 42:47.314
This disease can be cured?

42:48.774 --> 42:49.817
Is that true?

42:50.150 --> 42:52.945
That is what he said.

42:55.447 --> 42:58.534
"The cold valley that is foggy
four seasons of the year.

42:58.617 --> 43:02.413
The plant with a purple flower
that blooms in early autumn

43:02.496 --> 43:06.041
will resurrect a person who has died."

43:07.751 --> 43:09.587
Did you go to the valley to find it?

43:09.670 --> 43:11.839
I thought I could figure out a way

43:11.922 --> 43:16.010
to cure the diseased
if I found that plant, so I went there,

43:17.344 --> 43:19.346
but I couldn't find such a plant.

43:19.680 --> 43:22.850
For now, there is no way
to cure this disease.

43:26.979 --> 43:27.813
Your Highness.

43:28.355 --> 43:30.024
I need to tell you something.

43:40.367 --> 43:42.328
I cannot find Commander Cho's head.

43:42.745 --> 43:44.163
If someone took it

43:45.331 --> 43:47.082
to Cho Hak-ju...

43:49.418 --> 43:50.794
This is utterly frustrating.

43:53.714 --> 43:56.258
You should've talked to him nicely.
Why did you do that?

43:57.009 --> 43:59.637
He is Cho Hak-ju's precious only son.

43:59.720 --> 44:02.139
If he receives that only son's
decapitated head,

44:03.098 --> 44:04.642
he won't forgive us.

44:04.725 --> 44:06.852
I won't forgive him either.

44:06.935 --> 44:07.811
Pardon?

44:09.772 --> 44:13.317
You were accused of treason
and fled all the way to Dongnae.

44:13.734 --> 44:15.653
How do you plan to fight him?

44:16.070 --> 44:17.655
I have a justification now.

44:19.156 --> 44:20.282
I must gather support.

44:20.532 --> 44:21.408
Justification?

44:22.785 --> 44:23.744
What justification?

44:29.124 --> 44:30.334
Stay alive.

44:37.716 --> 44:39.176
You must stay alive.

44:46.767 --> 44:47.851
Father...

44:51.355 --> 44:52.314
has passed away.

44:55.734 --> 44:56.652
Pardon?

44:59.321 --> 45:00.906
His Majesty has passed away?

45:02.574 --> 45:04.076
Cho Hak-ju and the Queen

45:04.743 --> 45:06.829
used the resurrection plant on him

45:08.122 --> 45:09.540
after he passed away...

45:11.417 --> 45:12.876
to protect their authority.

45:18.173 --> 45:20.050
That journal and that female physician

45:20.926 --> 45:22.469
will testify to that fact.

45:26.181 --> 45:27.057
Sangju...

45:29.101 --> 45:30.853
I shall go to Lord Ahn Hyeon.

45:37.317 --> 45:38.902
Hurry up. Hurry.

45:41.488 --> 45:44.116
Just a minute.

45:44.199 --> 45:46.118
Hurry. Move quickly.

45:52.541 --> 45:54.626
Finish up before people flock here.

45:55.753 --> 45:56.587
Let us go.

46:00.174 --> 46:01.842
Why is he bringing a pig?

46:06.221 --> 46:08.766
The ship is leaving! Hurry!

46:09.141 --> 46:11.101
Everyone ran away! Hurry up!

46:18.942 --> 46:21.278
Hey! Excuse me!

46:21.361 --> 46:22.905
Hey, what is going on?

46:23.113 --> 46:23.989
Take care!

46:39.421 --> 46:41.465
It's quicker by boat to Sangju.

46:41.882 --> 46:44.760
They are almost done fixing the ship,
so let's go to the dock.

47:02.569 --> 47:03.862
Oh, no!

47:03.946 --> 47:06.490
Don't leave us, my lord! Please!

47:06.573 --> 47:08.534
Take us with you!

47:09.493 --> 47:11.578
Don't abandon us!

47:11.662 --> 47:14.748
Please take us with you!

47:14.832 --> 47:16.041
My lord!

47:16.124 --> 47:19.586
- Please take our baby! Just our baby!
- Please come back!

47:31.014 --> 47:31.932
Why those...

47:32.015 --> 47:34.726
They should do something
instead of just whining.

47:34.810 --> 47:36.436
Why are they so foolish?

47:39.815 --> 47:42.025
Is it okay for us to do this?

47:42.609 --> 47:47.197
It is impossible to get rid
of all the corpses before the sun sets.

47:47.281 --> 47:49.908
It will be mayhem again at night.

47:49.992 --> 47:51.743
Staying there

47:51.827 --> 47:54.830
is like running into fire
carrying kindling.

47:56.206 --> 48:00.794
You and the noblemen
are the pillars that sustain Dongnae.

48:00.878 --> 48:01.920
- Right.
- I agree.

48:02.004 --> 48:05.048
You must stay alive and rebuild Dongnae.

48:12.431 --> 48:15.642
You are positive that the Crown Prince
left Dongnae safely, right?

48:15.726 --> 48:17.519
Yes, of course.

48:17.603 --> 48:20.480
I saw the two of them leave
with my own eyes.

48:20.564 --> 48:22.774
You need not worry, my lord.

48:22.858 --> 48:25.777
Did he take that female physician
with him?

48:26.361 --> 48:27.195
Who?

48:28.947 --> 48:30.908
Never mind.

48:31.617 --> 48:34.161
- Excuse me.
- Do not worry, and--

48:34.328 --> 48:35.329
- Hey.
- My lord.

48:45.756 --> 48:46.965
Will it be okay?

48:47.424 --> 48:49.217
The Crown Prince is still there.

48:50.260 --> 48:51.887
If he finds out we left like this,

48:53.138 --> 48:54.264
he will have our heads.

48:55.557 --> 48:58.727
We shot arrows at the Crown Prince
last night.

48:59.227 --> 49:03.190
He said he'll annihilate our families.
We are dead either way.

49:04.650 --> 49:05.484
But...

49:06.568 --> 49:08.654
Okay. Good.

49:27.297 --> 49:28.590
Come on, now.

49:28.966 --> 49:30.634
Don't worry.

49:30.968 --> 49:33.679
The Cho clan has control
over the Lees in this world.

49:34.012 --> 49:34.846
If we...

49:36.848 --> 49:40.769
stay on the magistrate's good side,
we will be able to find a way to survive.

54:46.283 --> 54:48.285
Subtitle translation by Jeong Lee
